    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save The Village is a captivating medieval tower defense game that puts you in the role of a village protector. Each village you defend is under siege by waves of skeleton warriors, goblins, and powerful bosses. You must build, upgrade, and strategically position towers, and use magic to stop the enemies in their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through  unique villages, each with its own atmosphere, challenges, and geography. From the tranquil hills of Startville to the fiery depths of Inferno Hollow, every level brings new enemies, bosses, and tactical challenges. Will you be able to defend the villages and stop the dark forces threatening the kingdom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against waves of skeletons, goblins, and powerful bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade towers with unique abilities and strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautifully designed villages, each with its own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful magic and skills to dominate the battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience challenging gameplay with deep strategy and tactical elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign, built for PC</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control, plan your defenses, and protect the villagers in this epic medieval adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save The Village is a captivating medieval tower defense game that puts you in the role of a village protector. Each village you defend is under siege by waves of skeleton warriors, goblins, and powerful bosses. You must build, upgrade, and strategically position towers, and use magic to stop the enemies in their tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through  unique villages, each with its own atmosphere, challenges, and geography. From the tranquil hills of Startville to the fiery depths of Inferno Hollow, every level brings new enemies, bosses, and tactical challenges. Will you be able to defend the villages and stop the dark forces threatening the kingdom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend against waves of skeletons, goblins, and powerful bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade towers with unique abilities and strengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautifully designed villages, each with its own challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful magic and skills to dominate the battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience challenging gameplay with deep strategy and tactical elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign, built for PC</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control, plan your defenses, and protect the villagers in this epic medieval adventure!</p>",
